abstract: >-
  An educational, independently maintained reimplementation of Positional
  Encoding Projected Sampling (PEPS), with course-fast and paper-exact
  protocols. Repository-produced numerical artifacts are not reproduction
  evidence unless their run manifests mark them verified.
